 response←SaveGroupHompeage request;content;email;apiKey;groupName;html;clean;removed;msg
 :If ⊃G.INI.Get'Config:GroupHomePages'
     groupName←request R.GetQueryParameter'group'
     email←request R.GetQueryParameter'email'
     apiKey←request R.GetQueryParameter'apiKey'
     content←request.Content
     (clean removed)←RemoveHtmlTags content
     :If removed
     ⍝ Rather than silently saving something the user did not write we hand it back for polishing.
         msg←'HTML is not permitted here, but your text contains at least one HTML tag. Please remove it and save again.'
         response←request ReturnHTML(content email msg)EditGroupHomepage_ groupName
     :Else
         SaveGroupHompeage_ groupName clean email
         response←ReturnGroupHomepage groupName request
     :EndIf
 :Else
     response←RespondWithHTML 401 'Not authorized'
 :EndIf
⍝Done
